OL,3,GNEWSAJohnny Marr guitar could fetch
OL,4,A#30k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA guitar used by Johnny Marr after his
OL,7,Fsplit from The Smiths could fetch up to
OL,8,F#30,000 when it goes under the hammer
OL,9,Fnext month.
OL,11,FThe white Fender American Vintage 1962
OL,12,FReissue Stratocaster was played during
OL,13,FMarr's time with British rock band The
OL,14,FThe which he joined in 1988, a year
OL,15,Fafter leaving The Smiths.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
