OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJohnny Marr guitar could fetch
OL,4,A#30k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuctioneers Gardiner Houlgate said a
OL,7,Fprivate owner bought the guitar in
OL,8,F2020, with Marr - originally from
OL,9,FManchester - signing the guitar's
OL,10,Fheadstock at the time and providing a
OL,11,Fhandwritten postcard describing how it
OL,12,Fhad been used.
OL,14,FThe guitar will go on sale at the
OL,15,FGardiner Houlgate auction house in
OL,16,FCorsham, Wiltshire, on 8 December where
OL,17,Fit is estimated to fetch between
OL,18,F#20,000 and #30,000.
